sequenceDiagram
    %% Main successful flow; validation and alternatives are described in the guide.
    participant P0 as Duke
    participant P1 as AddPaymentCommand
    participant P2 as OrderList
    participant P3 as Order
    participant P4 as Ui
    P0->>P1: execute(...)
    P1->>P2: getAll()
    P2-->>P1: Order history
    P1->>P3: recordPayment(applied)
    P1->>P4: showPayment(...)
